+- `type`: Problem `type` URI reference, used when [`problemDetails`](#problem-details-rfc-9457) is enabled.
+- `instance`: Problem `instance` URI reference, used when [`problemDetails`](#problem-details-rfc-9457) is enabled.
 - `cause`: The original error object that caused this error, useful for tracing and debugging.
